{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4jq9srm","slide":3,"text":"“In the cloud” does not remove design, security, or operating responsibility.","textPreview":"“In the cloud” does not remove design, security, or operating responsibility.","textChars":77,"textLines":1,"bbox":[400,568,760,38]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ssnr8k","slide":3,"text":"15–25 min. Introduce the NIST definition in plain language. Emphasize that cloud changes how teams obtain and operate technology.\n\n[Sources]\nNIST SP 800-145, The NIST Definition of Cloud Computing. https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.SP.800-145"}
