{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e5svyd87","slide":11,"text":"Treat cost as a design constraint, not a monthly surprise.","textPreview":"Treat cost as a design constraint, not a monthly surprise.","textChars":58,"textLines":1,"bbox":[118,170,1010,50]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/pc3edsru","slide":11,"bbox":[88,251,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/obud4nqp","slide":11,"text":"Match capacity to demand; avoid paying for idle resources.","textPreview":"Match capacity to demand; avoid paying for idle resources.","textChars":58,"textLines":1,"bbox":[118,240,1010,50]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/it0nm5wr","slide":11,"bbox":[88,321,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3ut4vqxc","slide":11,"text":"Use tags, budgets, and usage data to make spending visible.","textPreview":"Use tags, budgets, and usage data to make spending visible.","textChars":59,"textLines":1,"bbox":[118,310,1010,50]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/4v25ovex","slide":11,"bbox":[88,391,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5wbmx0fi","slide":11,"text":"Balance cost against reliability, security, and delivery speed.","textPreview":"Balance cost against reliability, security, and delivery speed.","textChars":63,"textLines":1,"bbox":[118,380,1010,50]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/qxknq5wn","slide":11,"bbox":[72,504,1136,82]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ritozax8","slide":11,"text":"Ask before every design decision: What value does this resource create?","textPreview":"Ask before every design decision: What value does this resource create?","textChars":71,"textLines":1,"bbox":[104,529,1072,36]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y48qkq","slide":11,"text":"115–125 min. Avoid promising lower cost by default. Cloud makes usage visible and adjustable, but architecture and operating choices still determine cost."}
